cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PMB - Personal Memory Brain
message: >-
  If you use PMB in published research or build on top of it,
  please cite this software.
type: software
authors:
  - name: PMB contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/oleksiijko/pmb
abstract: >-
  Local-first persistent memory for AI coding agents over MCP.
  Hybrid BM25+vector retrieval with SQLite + LanceDB storage.
  Evidence-recall@10 on LoCoMo: 94.5% across the full 10-conversation
  run with default settings. Warm-recall p50 latency 65-195 ms;
  no API keys required.
keywords:
  - mcp
  - memory
  - retrieval
  - ai-agent
  - rag
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.3.0
